@startuml screenflow-regions
' Spec 002 — screen flow. Each state is a screen (key elements listed); each arrow is a user action.
' Every user story US-002-1..6 is a path through this diagram (see table in spec.md).

hide empty description
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor white
  BackgroundColor<<public>> #f8fafc
  BackgroundColor<<terminal>> #f1f5f9
  BorderColor #94a3b8
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam arrowFontSize 11

title Spec 002 — screen flow (375 px, Admin)

state "Drawer (☰)" as Drawer <<public>>
Drawer : Admin: Browse · Admin · Settings · Log out

state "Admin" as Admin
Admin : Regions
Admin : My listings · Post a job (added by spec 003)
Admin : (more sections arrive with 004 / 008)

state "Regions" as Regions
Regions : [ + Add region ]
Regions : Cebu              [Edit] [Hide]
Regions : Davao City        [Edit] [Hide]
Regions : Metro Manila      [Edit] [Hide]
Regions : Baguio  (hidden)  [Edit] [Show]
Regions : "Hidden regions stay on existing\nlistings but can't be chosen."

state "New region" as New
New : Name ______________
New : "We'll make the web address\nfrom the name: /jobs/<slug>"
New : [ Add region ]   Cancel

state "Edit region" as Edit
Edit : Name ______________
Edit : Address: /jobs/davao-city (fixed)
Edit : [ Save ]   Cancel

state "Operator terminal" as Terminal <<terminal>>
Terminal : mix ecto.setup / mix run priv/repo/seeds.exs
Terminal : (prod: release migrate + seed)

[*] --> Drawer : logged in as Admin
Drawer --> Admin : Admin
Admin --> Regions : Regions
Regions --> New : + Add region
New --> Regions : save (row added)
New --> New : validation error
New --> Regions : cancel
Regions --> Edit : Edit
Edit --> Regions : save (row renamed)
Edit --> Edit : validation error
Edit --> Regions : cancel
Regions --> Regions : Hide / Show\n(row toggles)
Terminal --> Regions : seed creates the\nthree launch regions
Terminal -[hidden]-> Drawer

legend right
  |= Shade |= Meaning |
  | light grey | shared navigation |
  | slate | operator only, not a screen |
endlegend

@enduml
